(aero-channel-extension)
*sixdof
*trajectory 1 derivative-aero start on 1
  *initial ecic x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=300 zdt=0 time=0 mass=100
  *segment 1 derivative-aero
    *aero sref=5.241 lrefx=2.58333 lrefy=2.58333
    *aero cx=0.12 cybeta=-0.02 cyr=0.01 czalpha=0.04 czq=-0.03 cl=0.01 clp=-0.02 cm=0.03 cmalpha=-0.04 cmq=-0.01 cnbeta=0.02 cnr=-0.03
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end
